Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:30.56,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HEE2928&\4c&HEE2928&\bord2\shad2}麻痹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.71,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\frz26.51\c&H414143&\pos(978,569)}此人
